---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | Tenda Peppers"
  description="Tenda Peppers cookie policy — what cookies are, which cookies we use on drychillis.com, and how to manage or disable them."
>
  <div class="container section">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: 2026-09-05</em></p>

    <p>
      This Cookie Policy explains how <strong>Leling Tenda Chili Products Co., Ltd.</strong> (trading as
      <strong>Tenda Peppers</strong>, "we", "us", "our") uses cookies and similar technologies on
      <strong>drychillis.com</strong> (the "Site"). This policy should be read together with our
      <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
    <p>
      Cookies are small text files that are placed on your device when you visit a website. They are
      widely used to make websites work, to remember your preferences and to help website operators
      understand how visitors use their site. Similar technologies include pixels, tags and local storage.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">2. Cookies We Use</h2>
    <p>We use the following categories of cookies on the Site:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Strictly necessary cookies</strong> — required for the Site to function correctly, such as
        enabling basic navigation, security and load balancing. These cannot be switched off.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Performance / analytics cookies</strong> — help us understand how visitors use the Site
        (for example, which pages are most visited) so that we can improve it. This information is
        collected in aggregate form.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Functional cookies</strong> — remember choices you make (such as language preference) to
        provide a more personalised experience.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">3. Specific Cookies and Purpose</h2>
    <p>The Site is a static informational website and uses a minimal set of cookies, which may include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Security and delivery cookies</strong> — set by our hosting and CDN provider (for example Cloudflare) to protect the Site and improve performance.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — set by an analytics service (where enabled) to collect aggregated, anonymised usage statistics.</li>
      <li><strong>Language preference</strong> — to remember your selected language (English, Spanish or Arabic).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We do not use advertising or third-party targeting cookies, and we do not use cookies to track you
      across other websites.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">4. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Some cookies may be set by third parties whose services we use, such as our hosting/CDN provider or
      an analytics provider. These third parties may process the data they collect in accordance with
      their own privacy policies. We do not control these third-party cookies.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">5. Your Choices and How to Manage Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      You can control and delete cookies through your browser settings. Most browsers allow you to block
      or delete cookies, and to be notified when a cookie is set. Please note that disabling strictly
      necessary cookies may affect the functionality of the Site.
    </p>
    <p>You can find guidance on managing cookies in the help section of your browser, for example:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Chrome: Settings → Privacy and security → Cookies</li>
      <li>Firefox: Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Cookies and Site Data</li>
      <li>Safari: Preferences → Privacy → Cookies and website data</li>
      <li>Edge: Settings → Cookies and site permissions</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an
      updated "Last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">7. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions about this Cookie Policy, contact us at
      <a href="mailto:joanna@paprikabulk.com">joanna@paprikabulk.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
